%   data: {"dataType":"text","outputData":{"text":"    StudentID         Case         Objective     Solver     Curtailment_MWh    Loss_MWh    GridCost_Yuan    MaxConeGap    SimultaneousPower_MW    MinACVoltage    MaxACVoltage\n    _________    ______________    _________    ________    _______________    ________    _____________    __________    ____________________    ____________    ____________\n\n    2.424e+08    \"case_nongcun\"       \"C\"       \"gurobi\"      3.7873e-08        1.8659         28605        0.0022735          1.1999e-08              0.95          1.0623   \n    2.424e+08    \"case_nongcun\"       \"B\"       \"gurobi\"          10.132       0.57613         38154        2.766e-07          2.3696e-08           0.97354               1   \n\n","truncated":false}}
